      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nYour opportunity to own a brand-new A-rated home — Help to Buy eligible buyers may qualify for up to 30,000 toward their deposit.A-Rated Detached Family Home in a Picturesque Village Setting\n\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a beautifully designed, energy-efficient A-rated detached residence, occupying a prime corner site within the popular Bruach na hAbhainn development in the charming village of Killeen, Maganey.\n\nThoughtfully designed with modern family living in mind, this impressive new home combines timeless architecture with contemporary interiors, generous proportions and outstanding energy efficiency. Enjoying a private rear garden overlooking open countryside, the property offers the perfect balance of village life and rural tranquillity.\n\nFrom the moment you arrive, the home's attractive façade and elevated position create an immediate sense of quality and kerb appeal. Internally, the accommodation has been carefully planned to maximise natural light while providing practical living spaces for modern family life.\n\nThe spacious entrance hall leads to a bright and welcoming living room, ideal for relaxing or entertaining. To the rear, the open-plan kitchen, dining and family area forms the heart of the home, with generous glazing creating a seamless connection to the private garden and surrounding countryside. A convenient guest WC completes the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, the first floor comprises three generously proportioned double bedrooms, including an impressive principal bedroom with ensuite bathroom. A beautifully appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, while excellent storage throughout ensures practicality for growing families.\n\nThe intelligent layout delivers a home that is equally suited to everyday living, entertaining guests or working from home.\n Accommodation\n\nBuilt to exacting standards, this exceptional new home offers outstanding comfort and efficiency, ensuring lower running costs and year-round comfort.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n* A-rated BER for exceptional energy efficiency\n* Air-to-water heat pump heating system\n* High-performance insulation throughout\n* Triple/High-performance double glazed windows\n* Contemporary fitted kitchen\n* Luxury bathroom and ensuite finishes\n* High-quality joinery\n* Excellent broadband availability\n* Off-street private parking\n* Generous private rear garden\n* Countryside views\n\nBruach na hAbhainn enjoys a peaceful setting on the edge of Killeen, a welcoming village nestled between Carlow and Athy, surrounded by beautiful rolling countryside.\n\nThe development offers the tranquillity of country living while remaining exceptionally well connected to nearby towns and commuter routes.\n\nThe property is ideally positioned for access to:\n\n* Carlow Town (approximately 15 minutes)\n* Athy (approximately 15 minutes)\n* Castledermot\n* Kilkea Castle\n* M9 Motorway providing easy access to Dublin and Waterford\n* Excellent primary and secondary schools nearby\n* Local shops, cafés, sporting clubs and community amenities\n\nFor outdoor enthusiasts, the surrounding area offers scenic walks, cycling routes, golf courses, equestrian facilities and the beautiful Barrow Valley, making it an ideal location for families seeking an active lifestyle."
      },
